# Vision Module

- Code lives in `packs/dms/vision/` (create when shipping V0).
- Placeholders: `VISION_MODEL`, `DEPTH_SOURCE`, `OCR_MODEL` — never hardcode providers.
- Generation models are NEVER used for measurement. Detection + depth/reference-marker only.
- Strip EXIF GPS on photo ingest. Blur/redact faces/plates before any off-box transfer.
- No auto-commit below confidence. Suggestions until human confirm + F5 compliance gate.
- Every vision fact writes to F1 ledger; success becomes Cortex skill via F6.
- Sequence: V0 (no ML) → V1 dimension → V2 slotting → V3 movement/map. See `docs/dms/VISION_GOVERNANCE.md`.
